      "review_summary": "The PR adds pre-provider read-target allowlist checks and regression tests for Feishu, Google Chat, Matrix, and Microsoft Teams read-style channel actions.\n\nPR surface: Source +415, Tests +823. Total +1238 across 8 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-reproducible from current main: read-style actions in the affected plugins call provider/native read helpers before the new target allowlist checks exist, although no live failing workspace was exercised in this review.",
